1
00:00:00,821 --> 00:00:04,111
(Leonard:)...trapped your knight in the corner,
and you keep sighing and saying:

2
00:00:04,324 --> 00:00:05,784
"Why me?"

3
00:00:07,661 --> 00:00:08,991
(Sheldon:)Very well.

4
00:00:09,204 --> 00:00:12,994
(Sheldon:)Can I ask you a question
about women?

5
00:00:14,042 --> 00:00:17,292
(Leonard:)We got you that book last year.
Wasn't everything in there?

6
00:00:17,504 --> 00:00:21,174
(Sheldon:)No. I'm having
a relationship problem with Amy.

7
00:00:22,384 --> 00:00:24,554
(Sheldon:)And by the way,
that book gave me nightmares.

8
00:00:25,887 --> 00:00:27,517
(Leonard:)If it makes you feel any better...

9
00:00:27,722 --> 00:00:30,062
...l screwed things up pretty good
with Penny.

10
00:00:30,767 --> 00:00:32,647
(Sheldon:)Look at us, Leonard.

11
00:00:32,853 --> 00:00:37,523
(Sheldon:)Engaging in the social convention of
men bellyaching about their old ladies.

12
00:00:38,066 --> 00:00:40,856
l guess we are. So...

13
00:00:41,069 --> 00:00:42,489
(Leonard:)What's going on?

14
00:00:42,696 --> 00:00:46,286
(Sheldon:)Believe it or not,
Amy has embarked on a campaign...

15
00:00:46,491 --> 00:00:51,411
(Sheldon:)...to increase my feelings for her
by making me happy.

16
00:00:53,582 --> 00:00:56,502
(Leonard:)I'm sorry,
that must be very difficuIt for you.

17
00:00:57,210 --> 00:00:59,380
(Sheldon:)It's awful. This morning...

